#, python-format
msgid ""
"This exercise already has the maximum of %(max)d image(s) allowed. Remove "
"one before adding another."
msgstr ""
"Denna övning har redan det tillåtna maximiantalet (%(max)d) bilder. Ta bort "
"en innan du lägger till en till."

